SY_TALK("nfpx_5tmLpc",[[3,["Today we are here to celebrate Krishna","Puja."]],[13,["I went to America and they wanted me","to have a Mahakali Puja."]],[22,["But I said, no, let me talk about Krishna","only,"]],[26,["because we have to first realize what is","the strength of this Puja."]],[38,["How are we going to establish Shri Krishna","within ourselves?"]],[44,["He, Himself has said, that whenever there","is a downfall of dharma -"]],[51,["dharma doesn’t mean what we understand","as Hinduism, Christianity"]],[57,["or Islamic nonsense - it is not."]],[61,["Dharma means, our primordial taboos that","are built-in in the human beings."]],[75,["About these, I think aboriginals knew","better than we."]],[79,["But then what we did, we dominated them"]],[83,["and also they had to change their style","of life."]],[89,["The primordial taboos are only understood"]],[93,["if people are trying to understand oneself"]],[100,["or else, whatever has come to them through","tradition."]],[107,["Now, Sahaj Dharma is a little bit","different,"]],[111,["in the sense that it’s much higher than","the Sahaj ideas that we talk of,"]],[122,["but it’s much higher than even what Shri","Krishna said or Shri Rama said."]],[129,["First Shri Rama thought, best is to give","them disciplines."]],[135,["People should be serious about life,","have full idea"]],[142,["about their own being, they should","respect themselves."]],[147,["All these things were written down long","time back."]],[154,["Also, people, basically when they were","good people,"]],[158,["they understood that whatever is bad","for us, we should not do."]],[164,["These are primordial taboos."]],[166,["Now, these primordial taboos are built-in","within us."]],[171,["Now, supposing I say don’t drink, you will","go on drinking."]],[180,["If I say don’t tell lies, you will tell","lies."]],[184,["It’s the human nature, you see, is to go","against primordial taboo"]],[190,["because they think now, they have freedom,"]],[193,["freedom to do what they like."]],[196,["You are free people. Actually they are not."]],[200,["They are under the spell of all the kinds","of allurement, you can call it,"]],[208,["or temptations, which are against human","life."]],[215,["And it’s very natural to be a person","of Dharma."]],[223,["Small children mostly have it. For example,","I’ve seen children,"]],[228,["they feel very shy to take out their","clothes,"]],[231,["even small, small boys, I’ve seen."]],[234,["They won’t take out their clothes in","the presence of others. They feel shy."]],[241,["So, all these are described like"]],[244,["“Ya Devi Sarva Bhuteshu Lajja Rupena","Samsthita”."]],[248,["So, you should be shy, you should be humble"]],[254,["and respect your body – it’s very","important."]],[258,["In these modern times, exposure of body is","regarded as a great achievement of women."]],[266,["They are trying to become aboriginals, you","see."]],[268,["That time they never had these ideas and","they were not so confused, you see."]],[273,["So, even if their women were scantily","dressed,"]],[277,["it didn’t mean that it was some sort","of a sex"]],[281,["or some sort of an attraction for men"]],[287,["or men behaving in funny manners"]],[291,["to show that they have a special attraction","for women."]],[296,["I mean, why should you?"]],[300,["It is absolutely absurd that men should be","attracted to women"]],[306,["and women should be attracted to men -"]],[309,["and on the road, on the street, you go,","you see, just that going on!"]],[315,["This adharma is the worst I think, it’s","a curse."]],[321,["Because after coming to Sahaja Yoga also"]],[323,["people start doing this nonsense, you know."]],[325,["They should all go to lunatic asylum,","I think,"]],[327,["they are no good for Sahaja Yoga."]],[330,["But dharma gets established as soon as you","have the light of the Spirit."]],[336,["At the time of Shri Rama, He had to put","down: A, B, C, D, E, F."]],[346,["At the time of Moses, also, He had to put","down ten commandments -"]],[354,["but Krishna thought the other way round -"]],[359,["to establish a Dharma of pure love, pure","love."]],[367,["So, because He wanted that Shri Rama’s","taboos were forced on people,"]],[375,["just like Islamic, just like Christians -","never works."]],[380,["So, He thought better to ask them in their","freedom,"]],[384,["they must develop pure love."]],[387,["Radha, who was with Him, as His power,","is called as Alladha dayini."]],[394,["She’s the one who gives joy. Pure joy!"]],[402,["So, all these limited type of attractions","end up in trouble."]],[410,["Now, drinking is against you, you know","that."]],[413,["Today they are talking about tobacco,","tomorrow they’ll talk of drinking"]],[418,["when they will find so many people","suffering from horrible livers and dying."]],[424,["Then they will taboo it."]],[426,["But it’s a natural taboo for your body."]],[430,["If you do something all the time which is","not good for you,"]],[436,["for your good life, you are becoming","adharmic."]],[443,["This is to be understood very clearly"]],[446,["that the Sahaja Dharma is that you are","just free -"]],[458,["complete freedom from lust, greed and all","nonsense."]],[462,["You are above it. You are above this."]],[467,["Sahaj Dharma is above the Dharma"]],[470,["established by Shri","Krishna or by Shri Rama."]],[475,["Because you have reached that stage."]],[478,["It’s in complete freedom you have to be","dharmic."]],[484,["Whatever is not good for you, you should","not do."]],[488,["I don’t have to tell you that you don’t do","this or you don’t do that."]],[495,["Whatever I say may not be acceptable"]],[499,["but immediately your vibrations will tell","you."]],[502,["This is Sahaj Dharma. In the Sahaj Dharma","you get rid of all kinds of,"]],[509,["as they say: (Hindi words) kaama, krodha,","mada, matsa, lobha, moha."]],[511,["Means – lust, anger, attractions, then –","greed;"]],[534,["that’s very important, greed – greed and","attractions."]],[543,["Now, if you understand how people are","greedy; greedy for what?"]],[552,["This America is dying of consumerism, you","see."]],[556,["Now, see the trick of the trade:"]],[560,["In America, you can borrow any amount","of money from the bank, no problem."]],[566,["Now, even if you don’t borrow, they’ll send","you a letter,"]],[573,["“Why don’t you take twenty thousand","checks we are sending you, why not have it?"]],[579,["Ah, very rich you’ll become, you see – it’s","very nice to take the loan.”"]],[587,["I was told some people used to come","to Ganapatipule after taking loans."]],[591,["I said, “Stop that nonsense.”"]],[594,["So they take the loan and then they come","to Ganapatipule."]],[600,["All the time their mind is: “How will I pay","this loan, how will I manage?”"]],[606,["All the time the attention is distracted,"]],[609,["even when you want to do something good","to yourself by coming to Ganapatipule."]],[616,["So, such a mind is not free."]],[622,["The free mind is that which has attention","completely enlightened by the Spirit."]],[631,["But problem is we are still rising out","of this human bondage"]],[639,["to a higher life of realization."]],[645,["And when we are going to that level, we","have to realize"]],[651,["that we have to give up all these shackles,"]],[657,["all these horrible things within us."]],[661,["Like a bird, when it is born out","of the egg,"]],[667,["shakes out all the parts of the egg."]],[671,["Your brothers, your sisters, your father,","your mother, your husband;"]],[675,["everybody – they’ll try to put you down."]],[682,["Now, if they are drinking, they’ll say,","“Come along,"]],[684,["you better have something to drink, you","are not social,"]],[688,["you are useless, you are not up to date.","What is this nonsense?”"]],[693,["That’s how a fashion starts and this","collective action of fashion"]],[701,["didn’t come from Shri Krishna and not","in Sahaj."]],[707,["In Sahaj, you are absolutely free from all","these nonsenses."]],[715,["If you want, you can wear a good dress,"]],[718,["if you don’t want you need not. You are","free."]],[723,["You are free from money bondage. This is","very important."]],[727,["Money bondage is another thing. I know","some Sahaja Yogis"]],[731,["who came to Sahaja Yoga trying to make","money out of Sahaja Yoga."]],[734,["You came to Sahaja Yoga for what?"]],[737,["To get out of that money bondage."]],[740,["In the Sahaj Dharma, to you money is","nothing but the dust of your feet."]],[746,["Nothing so important."]],[749,["Then, we have such a collective sense","of accepting nonsense."]],[757,["That has to be dropped out, especially","in America, I was surprised."]],[762,["Also in England. A fellow came as a hippie."]],[774,["His hair was looking like some monkey,"]],[780,["monkey’s better I must say, I don’t know","like what,"]],[783,["all put together like a, you can say…"]],[788,["I mean, there is nothing to compare, I tell","you."]],[792,["So I asked him, “Why are you having such","hair?”"]],[796,["He said, “Because I want to be primitive."]],[799,["Now, we have to get to the primitiveness.”"]],[802,["I said, “But your brain is modern,"]],[804,["what is the use of growing your hair like","that?"]],[806,["You think you can become primitive?","You cannot!”"]],[813,["Then afterwards I learned that he died."]],[817,["Another one like that came and he didn’t","die,"]],[822,["but went to lunatic asylum."]],[825,["Like that I met many, but why do you do it?"]],[829,["Because that’s the fashion."]],[832,["Now Italy, you know, is prospering because","of all kinds of designers."]],[841,["Now there is a joke about the new rich","people, in Russia especially."]],[849,["Russians are not like that, normally."]],[852,["They don’t accept something because it is","a fashion."]],[857,["So, one fellow said that: “My God, you lost","your hand in that accident!”"]],[867,["“Doesn’t matter, but I lost my very","expensive watch from Switzerland.”"]],[874,["“Really? What?” “It was a Rolex.”"]],[877,["Doesn’t matter if the hand is gone."]],[879,["The Rolex is gone! Rolex is the fashion."]],[883,["[Can you remove him down, this one,","because people can’t see you.]"]],[888,["So these are new rich people who have","money."]],[893,["(Dog is on the stage: It’s alright now,","he’ll be able. Come along, come along. Ah."]],[899,["Sit down, sit down. Now go down)"]],[911,["They (the dogs) don’t follow any fashions,"]],[913,["I have not seen dogs taking to any","fashions."]],[917,["Monkeys is taking - I mean, supposing, you","see the Italian designers"]],[922,["make something special for them, they","won’t think much of it."]],[927,["Maybe their masters might buy it, but not","these animals."]],[934,["Now, we don’t have to become animals","of course,"]],[937,["but we don’t also have to become","slaves of fashions."]],[942,["So there are some shops which are very","expensive."]],[945,["Why? Because they are designers."]],[948,["So you move about telling everybody, “See,","I am wearing this thing"]],[952,["from a designer shop, this is from designer","shop.”"]],[956,["That means, what about you?"]],[959,["You have no sense of designs, you have","no sense of understanding"]],[965,["what you need and what you don’t need."]],[968,["And nowadays most of them are in jail also,","sorry to say,"]],[972,["but they have money and they have made","money by befooling you."]],[978,["Specially in America I was surprised that","they were selling most of the things"]],[984,["which were coming from Italy designs,","Italian designs,"]],[988,["written down Italian design, so they were","buying it, Italian design."]],[994,["I was surprised that such artistic things","they create"]],[1000,["that are available everywhere, such","beautiful things."]],[1006,["But what they believe in, is some sort","of a group madness."]],[1014,["Everybody wearing the same kind of design","is from this or that."]],[1020,["This is not Sahaj Dharma. We are not","slaves of anything."]],[1023,["We are free people. We have not to accept","any design or anything."]],[1027,["Ah, it is there, is there! Let the stupid","follow that."]],[1032,["We are Sahaja Yogis."]],[1035,["Now, this also prevails among people who","are supposed to be sadhus,"]],[1040,["they all dress up the same way."]],[1044,["How can you make out who is who?"]],[1047,["In Sahaja Yoga, we don’t want you to dress","up the same way,"]],[1050,["look the same way, cut your hair the same","way. No."]],[1055,["You have to be individuals, because you","are free,"]],[1058,["but that doesn’t mean - freedom is always","supported by wisdom -"]],[1064,["that doesn’t mean that you do what you","like."]],[1068,["All kinds of funny things happen when","a person doesn’t know"]],[1074,["what is the light of the Spirit.","In the light of the Spirit,"]],[1079,["you don’t get involved into this kind","of collective madness that is going on."]],[1086,["We are so collective in mad things."]],[1090,["I wish they could be collective more","in wise things."]],[1095,["Wisdom is very important and a joy-giving","quality of Radhaji,"]],[1102,["Ahlada Dayini Shakti, has to come within","us."]],[1106,["Means, when we meet another person","in the collectivity,"]],[1111,["another person should feel happy meeting","you."]],[1116,["So He taught the Dharma of love."]],[1121,["Love is not there if you discard because","he is black or because he is brown,"]],[1127,["because he is white. It’s very","superficial -"]],[1134,["what is black, white and yellow? I don’t","understand."]],[1138,["Here they go to the sea shores to make","themselves black"]],[1143,["and there they say, “We don’t want to have","any blacks,” specially for Americans."]],[1152,["I think this kind of separation I found","there,"]],[1158,["among the blacks and the whites, I really","wept."]],[1163,["I went to Harlem. Sahaja yogis said,","“Mother, will you go to Harlem?”"]],[1167,["I said, “Why not, I’m black. If you call","me black, I’m black."]],[1171,["If you call me white, I’m white. If you","call me yellow, I’m yellow."]],[1176,["So, I’m going.” And there I had a lecture,","you know,"]],[1179,["so many people were there, really I cannot","forget."]],[1182,["It is one of the most famous place that","there is built in that hall"]],[1190,["and the same hall is built in Australia","where I had addressed many people."]],[1199,["I thought, “Just look at this!” They said,","“Mother, the Australians copied from us.”"]],[1205,["Now, these people, so sweet, so beautiful,","I tell you."]],[1208,["I could see their heart, I could feel it","and the fellow was trying to compere."]],[1214,["After my lecture he just came, he hugged","me, kissed me."]],[1217,["I mean, he would have even minced me,","a little boy"]],[1221,["about twenty-two years of age; such love","he felt."]],[1227,["And he said, “Mother, next time You come,","You are going to come to Harlem.”"]],[1230,["But I am told that hall is closed."]],[1233,["So the Americans system somehow or another","goes against democracy,"]],[1242,["not only against democracy but against","what Abraham Lincoln wanted."]],[1249,["They had such a great man there"]],[1255,["and there is a little street I saw in his","name."]],[1258,["Of course in Washington they say they have","some nice, beautiful statues."]],[1267,["But otherwise his principles are finished,"]],[1272,["his ideals are finished because somehow","or other,"]],[1280,["some people came and wrote against -"]],[1282,["from England especially - against the black","people."]],[1291,["What business they have to write against","something that is created by God?"]],[1296,["If there are the same colours everywhere,"]],[1299,["they all will look like military people."]],[1302,["They have to have different colors,"]],[1305,["they have to have different hues."]],[1307,["See, look at the trees, look at","the flowers."]],[1311,["And look at the different hues the sky has,"]],[1316,["just to make us happy – Alladha."]],[1320,["What gives you happiness is variety.","Variety is a sign of beauty."]],[1326,["If there is no variety, it’s so boring","I tell you, so very boring."]],[1332,["But they are very proud of it and they","think no end of themselves."]],[1337,["They think they are very great people, they","have a sense of superiority,"]],[1342,["because they have a certain type of nose"]],[1345,["or maybe certain type of lips or maybe","certain types of hair."]],[1351,["Such stupid things they are and you join","hands with them."]],[1355,["How can you join hands with them?"]],[1357,["You want your freedom? Then be a free","person."]],[1361,["In the freedom you have to have variety,","very important."]],[1367,["I would say that, now, the Sahaja Yogis who","are going back to America"]],[1371,["should have a new style of drive: go","to the black people."]],[1378,["I was very happy to see the South American","seminar,"]],[1383,["that they had taken specially to aboriginal","people."]],[1389,["They went and met them. I have met them","also"]],[1392,["and I was so surprised"]],[1395,["that they immediately said, “Mother,","You are spiritual, we know,"]],[1399,["but can You solve our problem?” I said,","“What’s your problem?”"]],[1402,["“Very simple, we have a land.”","“It’s alright, then?”"]],[1407,["“Very little land, five, six acres of land"]],[1410,["that belongs to us where the sage grows.”"]],[1413,["Sage is a kind of a, according to them,","is a holy plant. All right."]],[1420,["“Now, we always meet, all of us, there","for different festivals"]],[1426,["because we regard that land as a holy","land.”"]],[1429,["They know so many things, you know."]],[1431,["This is a holy land - there were vibrations","for that."]],[1435,["So they always used to meet. So natural!"]],[1440,["“So, what has happened now, what is your","problem?”"]],[1443,["“The government has sold this land, this","American government, to an Indian.”"]],[1448,["I said, “To an Indian?” “Yes, so can you","request this Indian"]],[1452,["to return it to us? We’ll pay him the","money.”"]],[1455,["I said, “What’s the name of the Indian?”"]],[1457,["They told me the name, I said, “My God!"]],[1460,["He is a Sindhi, Sindhi!"]],[1463,["He won’t leave you even one single pai,","is he going to give you this?"]],[1467,["I’m sorry, I may be Divine or I may be","anything, I can’t help you.”"]],[1473,["But I was surprised nobody raised a voice","against it."]],[1478,["They should have raised voice. They should","have told the government,"]],[1480,["“Please return their land. Why do you want","to have it?"]],[1484,["Why want to grab it?” As it is all","the Americans are immigrants."]],[1490,["They don’t belong to that place, that they","were not owners of that place,"]],[1496,["they’d gone – they are immigrants."]],[1499,["So they have no right to keep somebody’s","land like that"]],[1503,["and then to think they are superior.","It’s very nice,"]],[1506,["somebody enters your house and thinks he is","very superior"]],[1509,["and drives out all the people","of the family."]],[1513,["That is what has happened in America and","just opposite is Sahaj Dharma."]],[1518,["With Sahaj Dharma, you take people into","your heart, you love them."]],[1527,["Your love flows all the time, your","compassion flows all the time."]],[1532,["To me it’s a problem, this body is more","compassionate than myself."]],[1537,["I don’t even think of compassion and this","body just grasps everything."]],[1541,["It wants to solve the problem of others"]],[1545,["but I don’t think you can have that kind","of a body, you shouldn’t have."]],[1549,["But, at least you should have a heart","which is open."]],[1554,["You see on the street somebody who is","a dark fellow."]],[1557,["I like about the black Americans, that","once I got down in one airport,"]],[1567,["so one gentleman, black gentleman said,","“Hello darling, how are You?"]],[1573,["How are You here? Very happy to see You!”"]],[1576,["“I’m happy to see you. How are you?”"]],[1579,["Then once I was traveling in... what was","the airport? Ursula was with me."]],[1590,["So he looked at me, one fellow, very tall,","hefty, fat, you know."]],[1596,["He said, “Ah! Are You back again?” “Ah”."]],[1600,["I said, “I’m back. You know me?”","“Of course, of course, I know You.”"]],[1604,["He had never met me, I had never known him."]],[1610,["But I felt happy, I felt very happy."]],[1615,["That’s the best way to meet people."]],[1618,["Supposing you are walking on the street,","you see some black gentleman going."]],[1623,["It’s a terrible life there, I tell you,","it’s a terrible life for them."]],[1627,["I’ve known, I’ve read books on them, I’ve","cried and wept and I felt very sorry."]],[1633,["So, as a Sahaja yogi, you should just jump","at them"]],[1637,["and you should say, “Hello, how are you?”","Shake hands with them."]],[1641,["They won’t cut your throat, I can tell you","this."]],[1646,["In criminality, I don’t know who is more","criminal in America,"]],[1650,["whether they are the blacks or","the whites, competing."]],[1654,["But, if you are kind and if you are loving,"]],[1657,["you can remove that part of criminality","which is within them"]],[1661,["because hatred can be only washed away","by pure love."]],[1667,["But people think they are very cunning,","very superior in cunningness, of course."]],[1672,["Otherwise, what is their superiority?"]],[1677,["Only this complexion, this white complexion","is the worst of all."]],[1682,["I was very fair, very fair, till I got","married, or for some time,"]],[1688,["and then I started becoming darker and","darker."]],[1691,["Because white complexion gets all kinds","of, see..."]],[1695,["the light you put on me, I absorb, I get","a black spot."]],[1699,["So it’s not a very great thing to be white,","I don’t think so."]],[1703,["It looks very funny and pale and joyless."]],[1707,["But no use going to the sea, making your","body, I think brown,"]],[1713,["brown, not so black, brown and then","suffering from cancer of the skin."]],[1722,["This kind of stupidity is also very much","fashionable."]],[1727,["Now, in collectivity, how much do we get","impressed"]],[1732,["by this, we should be on the watch."]],[1736,["I saw my granddaughter was wearing","a sleeveless dress."]],[1740,["I told her, “Better you shouldn’t wear","a sleeveless dress.”"]],[1743,["She says, “It’s very hot, I feel very hot.”","She’s young."]],[1746,["I said, “But see, these are two very","important chakras."]],[1750,["If you expose them, then you’ll have","a problem.”"]],[1755,["She doesn’t like to wear dresses which are","above the knee,"]],[1760,["but she says, “People wear even above","the knee.”"]],[1763,["I said, “Knees, they are very important","chakras, we should keep them closed,"]],[1769,["otherwise if they are affected, we’ll have","knee trouble.”"]],[1773,["Immediately she changed – immediately."]],[1777,["“Mother, I’ll wear blouse from inside and","something from outside.”"]],[1781,["Immediately. Because she knew this is","a natural primordial taboo"]],[1788,["that we should not expose our these two","chakras and these chakras."]],[1796,["But, nowadays, the more you have long","legs, I don’t know,"]],[1804,["they have shorter clothes."]],[1807,["And I don’t understand what is in the legs,"]],[1810,["the whole beauty is in the legs or what?"]],[1814,["So, I’ve met one lady who traveled with me."]],[1819,["She was wearing a burkha because she was","a Moslem"]],[1823,["and by the time we landed in London, she","took out the burkha"]],[1828,["and the dress was much above the knees."]],[1832,["I said, “What kind of Muslim woman is she?"]],[1836,["She’s worse than even Christians because","they wouldn’t wear such a thing."]],[1843,["You know, to come out of the aeroplane,"]],[1846,["you have to come down on the staircase.”"]],[1848,["No “Lajja”, no shame, nothing,","shamelessness!"]],[1855,["So, Sahaj Dharma is that you have shame,","you have sense of shame."]],[1863,["What you talk to others, what you say","to others,"]],[1866,["how you behave towards them, in the Sahaj","Dharma is Alladha dayini."]],[1873,["If something is not Alladha dayini, keep","quiet. Don’t say."]],[1878,["What is the need? What is there to be","sarcastic?"]],[1883,["Showing off your brains in your sarcasm."]],[1890,["It’s not a sign of good breeding"]],[1894,["that you talk sarcastically to others","in a sharp way."]],[1899,["But if you talk sweetly, what’s the harm?"]],[1903,["This sweetness comes from Radhaji."]],[1908,["Now, of course they have misused Her"]],[1911,["and made it into a sort of a Romeo and","Juliet business. It was not that way."]],[1916,["She was a very pure woman and She","was Mahalakshmi."]],[1923,["So, to be a Mahalaksmi, after coming","to Sahaja Yoga, you should know"]],[1930,["that you should dress up in a way that’s","perfectly alright."]],[1937,["Once I remember, I was in a big party","and one gentleman came"]],[1946,["and he sat down, “Aaaaaah!” I said,","“What happened?”"]],[1950,["“What a relief, Mother, Mrs. Shrivastava,","to see You."]],[1955,["See these women, I’m fed up. But You","came, I felt such a relief.”"]],[1963,["I said, “What is so relieving?” “You are","so serene.”"]],[1967,["So, women are serene in Sahaj Dharma."]],[1974,["They are not stupid, frivolous, laughing","at anything."]],[1979,["That’s not the way for a woman. Anything","happens, they must laugh."]],[1985,["I mean, there is something laughable,","alright,"]],[1988,["but some things are not even laughable,","they laugh."]],[1992,["That’s not the way. That can be ridiculous","also, can ridicule others."]],[1997,["But, laugh of appreciation, laugh","of enjoyment,"]],[2004,["is so pure and creates such a beautiful","atmosphere."]],[2010,["I think the whole ecological problem is in","our brains and your upbringing."]],[2017,["It is not outside."]],[2021,["It is inside us, which is reflected","outside."]],[2026,["In Ganesha Puja I’m going to tell you how","we are so closely related to Mother Earth"]],[2031,["and how the Mother Earth and the atmosphere","reacts"]],[2036,["to our behavior, to how we live."]],[2040,["In the Sahaj Dharma, you give up lust and","greed very easily, that I know."]],[2047,["I mean, if they can’t even give up that,"]],[2050,["then they should not call themselves Sahaja","Yogis."]],[2053,["The first thing you give up is lust and","greed."]],[2056,["I find it among young people now,"]],[2059,["that those who come to Sahaja Yoga","become really very free people."]],[2068,["They don’t run after women."]],[2072,["Women don’t run after men."]],[2075,["They are together, they sit together, talk","together, laugh together,"]],[2079,["but it is purity that is there."]],[2082,["In the Koran it is described that when","Kyama will come,"]],[2089,["beautiful women and beautiful men will","be there,"]],[2093,["but they’ll have no lust and greed, they’ll","be pure."]],[2097,["It is today, you can see – that lust and","greed is finished"]],[2104,["in most of you – most of you. Automatically","it is finished"]],[2108,["and now you can see for yourself that","you’re free of this bondage."]],[2116,["Then our marriages are coming tomorrow."]],[2129,["In the Sahaj Dharma, first thing is very","important is forgiveness."]],[2139,["If somebody cannot forgive, then he cannot","be a Sahaja Yogi -"]],[2144,["forgiveness. How this forgiveness comes in"]],[2149,["is by forgetting the past. Otherwise you’ll","go on saying,"]],[2155,["“This person tortured me, that person","tortured me,"]],[2158,["he was very mean to me, he was that to me,","he did this to me.”"]],[2163,["Shows that you are not of that calibre","to understand Sahaja Yoga -"]],[2169,["because you cannot forgive."]],[2173,["What is there to remember? The present is","the best."]],[2176,["Now if you are sitting here with me,","enjoying the Alladha dayini Shakti,"]],[2181,["that time if you are thinking about","the past, shows what?"]],[2185,["That you are not of the calibre."]],[2188,["To be the calibre of Sahaja Yoga, you","should be free of your past."]],[2194,["Finished. There's no need to confess."]],[2198,["I know after Sahaja Yoga many people wrote","letters to me of confessions"]],[2202,["and I just said, “Baba, just burn these","letters."]],[2207,["I don’t remember. I don’t want to read","anything about anyone.”"]],[2212,["So, there should be forgiveness."]],[2214,["If there is forgiveness, you’ll be","surprised,"]],[2217,["you’ll feel very relieved and your married","life will be very happy."]],[2222,["But if you try to remember something...","Alright,"]],[2226,["some marriages are really, really very","difficult, alright, so you get out."]],[2231,["In Sahaja Yoga we have allowed complete","divorce,"]],[2234,["but must be with some reason,"]],[2237,["not because you think something is","superior."]],[2240,["Now we have banned many countries"]],[2244,["from where we don’t want to have girls"]],[2246,["or from where we don’t want to have boys."]],[2249,["What is the reason? With experience we","have learned,"]],[2252,["they are not marriage substance."]],[2258,["Now, then better not marry."]],[2262,["And if you marry then live like an ideal","Sahaja Yogi."]],[2269,["Also, if you are a Sahaja Yogini,"]],[2272,["then you can carry on very much better","by forgiving all the time."]],[2278,["Every time, when people tell me,","“Mother,"]],[2281,["You see, You must help me.” “Why?”"]],[2284,["“Because, You know, my husband doesn’t","give me any money.”"]],[2288,["I said, “Give him up. I don’t mind."]],[2291,["He must give you money. Why doesn’t he","give you money?”"]],[2294,["If you talk to the husband, he’ll say,","“Mother, she’s very extravagant.”"]],[2298,["I said, “You better give up Sahaja Yoga","both of you and do what you like.”"]],[2304,["In Sahaj Dharma, the husband-wife’s","relation should be really romantic,"]],[2311,["should be really beautiful."]],[2313,["It is not, you know, we talk of love and","all that here,"]],[2316,["very rarely people fall in love and carry","on with it."]],[2321,["It’s a blessing if you really get that kind","of a feeling."]],[2325,["But mostly it is a curse."]],[2330,["So to fall in love is very good"]],[2334,["but that doesn’t mean you forget that you","are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2339,["In that, Sahaja Yoga helps a lot, I think,","in your married life."]],[2345,["Same, dharma is for your children, that you","bring up your children -"]],[2351,["not troubling them too much, but into","a free life."]],[2356,["Let them use their wisdom."]],[2358,["Sometimes I know children go astray and","try to follow wrong things."]],[2362,["Then you must correct them, you must tell","them, it is your duty."]],[2366,["They were not born out of the trees"]],[2369,["but they were born here, from the parents."]],[2373,["So it is the duty of the parents to tell","them that this is wrong"]],[2377,["and this should not be done."]],[2379,["It’s a very wrong thing, you should correct","that"]],[2382,["and that correction should be in a Sahaj","way."]],[2388,["I’ll tell you an example."]],[2393,["I had a problem once, with somebody","coming to me and saying,"]],[2401,["“Mother, I can’t do without smoking, I","have to smoke.”"]],[2406,["I said, “Better smoke then, but you can’t","be a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[2411,["because a smoking Sahaja Yogi is a funny","caricature, you know,"]],[2415,["I can’t think of a Sahaja Yogi smoking."]],[2418,["How will I look if I start smoking like","that?” “Ah, horrible!”"]],[2424,["I said, “Then if you are my son, you cannot","smoke, it looks bad.”"]],[2429,["He gave up smoking, can you imagine?"]],[2432,["So, dealing with children, always make","yourself an example,"]],[2437,["yourself part and parcel of that event."]],[2440,["So the children don’t feel, you know."]],[2444,["This is something that I have talked","many-a-times."]],[2453,["Children is one thing I tell you,"]],[2457,["they can give up everything but not your","love."]],[2461,["If they know you love them, they will not","accept anything"]],[2468,["that will make you not love - not love","them."]],[2475,["This is for definite, because children are","the best people who know about love."]],[2482,["Of course, I don’t know, I feel that","in English language,"]],[2486,["I didn’t see many books about children","written beautiful, beautiful things."]],[2493,["There was one book that was published","when I was in London:"]],[2496,["“The children talking about","the politicians”,"]],[2499,["and they published I think, 5000 books and","that very same day it was finished."]],[2505,["So, talk to children, talk to them. You’ll","be amazed, they are full of honey."]],[2511,["They have such nice, nice things with them"]],[2514,["and when they talk like that, then you","are amazed"]],[2519,["how they say things, how they talk","of Sahaj,"]],[2523,["how they are expressing their spiritual","strength."]],[2532,["Now, we have many very good children and","also they are absolutely Sahaj."]],[2542,["One boy came and he just prostrated himself","before me."]],[2547,["So, I said, “Why you did it?”"]],[2549,["“I was getting cool vibrations, Mother,","from You, so I did it.”"]],[2557,["“Is it, you like it?”","“Of course!”"]],[2560,["“More than chocolate?”","“Of course!”"]],[2564,["I was surprised. “What... you eat them or","what?”"]],[2567,["“No, no need to eat, you know, you feel","so happy inside"]],[2572,["and I feel, Mother, You are putting Your","hand on my heart"]],[2577,["and trying to console me.”"]],[2580,["I was surprised. “And where is your heart?”"]],[2583,["He said, “It’s here, here is my heart,","I feel it here.”"]],[2587,["Just imagine, what love and what","understanding of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2592,["For these little children who are below","even five years."]],[2598,["Now, you are all grown up children of mine"]],[2601,["and I want you to know all the beauties","that are within you,"]],[2606,["that you have to enjoy. First of all, learn","to laugh at yourself."]],[2610,["That’s the best way to enjoy yourself,","you know."]],[2615,["And not to spend much time looking in","the mirror, that’s another way."]],[2623,["You spend too much at the mirror, then","there’s something wrong with you."]],[2626,["I think, personally, that it’s a kind of","a possession may be."]],[2631,["So, what you should see inside: “Are we","Sahaj Dharmies?”"]],[2638,["Mother has established Sahaj Dharma,"]],[2640,["much more than what Krishna wanted","to establish."]],[2644,["He wanted to establish the Dharma of love","which of course we have,"]],[2649,["but apart from that we have so many other","beautiful facets"]],[2654,["and such beautiful things within our","personality"]],[2659,["that we have forgotten to enjoy."]],[2665,["So, the attention should be on your own","qualities, on your own personalities"]],[2671,["and then you’ll be amazed how your","personality is giving you joy,"]],[2679,["giving you Alladha, giving you so much","of patience with others."]],[2688,["To Me the whole thing looks like sometimes","a joke"]],[2692,["because nothing so serious."]],[2697,["It’s not a Rama’s type that you have","to be serious."]],[2701,["I don’t have to kill anybody, I don’t use","any weapons in this lifetime."]],[2709,["Without weapons if things are solved, what","can you do?"]],[2712,["But you must try to see the beauty","as Sahaja Yogis."]],[2716,["You should be sensitive to see how you","have been helped,"]],[2721,["how you have been guided, how you have","been blessed."]],[2725,["This is sahaj dharma."]],[2728,["If you cannot know that, then you live","on a very low level."]],[2732,["I mean, it’s not fault of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2735,["but it’s your style, you are not sensitive."]],[2740,["Supposing somebody does not know that he","is burning his hand."]],[2748,["So what will you do?"]],[2751,["He has no sense, he has no sensitivity,","he cannot feel."]],[2755,["He can drink, he can smoke, he can do","everything"]],[2758,["and still he Is existing, alright."]],[2762,["Must be a rakshasa, I think or I don’t know","what to say."]],[2767,["So, we have to take example from other good","Sahaja Yogis"]],[2772,["and not from the bad ones and how do we","proceed in enjoyment -"]],[2781,["which is a ocean, just an ocean."]],[2784,["For example, now, I came, everybody was","trying to fan."]],[2789,["But also in the West another problem is"]],[2792,["they like to live in hermetically sealed","rooms, hermetically sealed cars,"]],[2796,["they are very afraid of draught, I don’t","know, as if they’ll be thrown away"]],[2800,["or what will happen to them. They don’t","want draught."]],[2804,["I mean draught is not coming from some","iceberg."]],[2808,["So, they don’t believe in the fresh air","at all"]],[2813,["and that’s one other reason that people are","very suffocating sometimes, you know,"]],[2820,["they just suffocate. They are used","to a suffocating life."]],[2824,["Once I was in India, I was very hot, so","somebody was driving me,"]],[2830,["but the person who was there was from","a Western country."]],[2835,["He said, “Don’t open - don’t open","the window.”"]],[2837,["I said, “Why?” “There’s a draught.”","I said, “In this country, in India"]],[2841,["people live in the open. What is a draught?"]],[2845,["What draught you are talking about?”"]],[2848,["You can’t open the door, you can’t open","the window,"]],[2851,["you can’t open anything, if you open","anything,"]],[2854,["they’ll be all dead, you see as if.","So open yourself!"]],[2860,["As it is about the nature, also it is","in their private lives."]],[2866,["They don’t want to open."]],[2871,["If somebody comes to their house,","“Oh, my God,"]],[2874,["now we’ll have to share the wines,"]],[2877,["we’ll have to share the foods.” They cannot","share."]],[2884,["They cannot share. That is most","uncollective."]],[2893,["But in India, I must say, people have","a good sharing capacity"]],[2897,["because they are still primitive, they are","still primordial,"]],[2904,["yet not gone out of the way to satisfy","their own ego."]],[2912,["But I think somehow or other in India,","people like to share."]],[2926,["If you want to please any Indian, you tell","them,"]],[2929,["“tomorrow I’ll come and have food with","you.” His wife will jump."]],[2933,["She’ll say, “Now what do you like, tell me,","what food do you like?”"]],[2938,["She will jump. But otherwise, what happens,"]],[2943,["as soon as you say he Is coming for food,","the wife will say,"]],[2947,["“No, no, I am going to my mother.”"]],[2953,["Immediately she’ll have a programme."]],[2960,["I just don’t understand. They’ll have","beautiful houses,"]],[2963,["very clean, very beautiful everything,"]],[2967,["but if somebody comes to their house, they","get a shock"]],[2970,["as if electricity has entered. So, for whom","is all this?"]],[2979,["To show off, they will borrow money from","the banks."]],[2983,["Even Indians in America they do."]],[2986,["They want to have three Mercedes, four","houses, for what?"]],[2993,["Borrowing money, with borrowing money","they’ll do it."]],[2997,["Sahaja Yogis have not to borrow any money."]],[3003,["There is no need, you can do away with","things."]],[3007,["Why to have so many cars?"]],[3010,["Nowadays, people don’t even walk at all."]],[3013,["We used to go to our school, my father had","a car in India - nothing doing."]],[3020,["We had to walk. We used to climb one","mountain."]],[3023,["It was about five miles the school – every","morning."]],[3027,["Then in the night, in the evening, the car","used to come, you see."]],[3032,["And I would walk with my bare feet,"]],[3036,["because so much vibrations were there,","and the chappals,"]],[3040,["I thought were cutting my vibrations,"]],[3042,["so I used to have chappals in my hand and","walk."]],[3047,["One day, we had a new driver, my father","sent him."]],[3051,["He said, “How will I know who is","your daughter?”"]],[3053,["He said, “Any girl with the chappals in her","hand is the one whom you have to bring.”"]],[3061,["So, it is to enjoy your nobility, to enjoy","your generosity."]],[3069,["It’s very important. And not to side","with anyone."]],[3074,["You are not identified with anyone."]],[3078,["It’s much better now, I think, because","since you have taken to Sahaj Dharma,"]],[3083,["I’ve seen - English will tell you what’s","wrong with English,"]],[3087,["Swiss will tell you what’s wrong with","Swiss,"]],[3089,["Indians will tell you what’s wrong with","Indians. Actually, I learnt from them."]],[3093,["I don’t know these things are there."]],[3095,["Russians will tell you what’s wrong with","Russians."]],[3099,["They immediately start seeing, “What’s","wrong with us?"]],[3103,["Where do we lack in this?”"]],[3107,["Because the collectivity of being in one","country, say as an Indian,"]],[3115,["we see now, what’s happening in India,","all corrupt, horrible, this, that."]],[3122,["So, I said, “Alright, if you don’t like","India, why don’t you go somewhere else?”"]],[3125,["“No, no, no, no, that - we will stay here,"]],[3128,["but this is a very corrupt government, they","are very bad, this, that.”"]],[3135,["Anywhere you go, you will find immediately","they see -"]],[3139,["because you don’t know they are now chosen","to change their country."]],[3148,["I have taken up many questions now,","of India"]],[3153,["and I’m going to start working on that","level now."]],[3157,["We have already started, in a way, for","the destitute women,"]],[3163,["then for other type of poverty and all","that."]],[3166,["Just by saying, remove poverty, poverty","cannot be lost."]],[3170,["You have to have feeling for the poor,","then only."]],[3174,["But you get with more that feeling because","you are an Indian."]],[3181,["You are an Indian, so what? Your own","brothers, sisters starving."]],[3185,["You get that very deep feeling within you","if you are a Sahaj Dharmi."]],[3191,["So, this is the new Dharma we have","established now in this world."]],[3195,["A new race, with a new Dharma, which is","much above"]],[3200,["even Shri Krishna’s vision is coming","through."]],[3204,["He describes in the beginning. I think,","He was not a good salesman,"]],[3210,["because He describes the best first;"]],[3213,["you see, the salesman first will start from","two rupees,"]],[3217,["then go onward to two thousand rupies.","But He first told us"]],[3222,["that you have to become Sthita Pragnya,","means Sahaja Yogi -"]],[3226,["and then Shri Krishna was asked a question","by Arjuna,"]],[3231,["“What is a Sthita Pragya?” Then He","describes a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3234,["that He describes before, first chapter,","second chapter is that."]],[3239,["Now, then the questions start. You know,","Arjuna was a great questioner, I think."]],[3246,["So, he starts asking questions, “Then what","about this"]],[3249,["and what about that and what about that?”"]],[3252,["So He goes on explaining to him that,"]],[3255,["“You see, this is all just a Maya, this is","all an illusion you have."]],[3262,["Get out of this illusion."]],[3265,["If once you get out of this illusion,”","because Arjuna said,"]],[3269,["“They are my relations, they are my","teachers. How can I kill them?”"]],[3274,["So, Krishna says, “Nobody is killed.”"]],[3276,["He said, “Nobody is killed, but they are","being killed"]],[3279,["because they are not following the Satya","Dharma, so it’s alright.”"]],[3285,["What is your brother, what is your sister?"]],[3287,["They are not following the Satya Dharma,"]],[3289,["so you have nothing to do with them."]],[3291,["If you can correct them and help them,","it’s alright, otherwise forget them."]],[3296,["First, deal with people who are straight."]],[3300,["Like we should say that we must deal with","people who are simple, innocent"]],[3306,["and then you can take to difficult people","when you are that good."]],[3312,["Otherwise you will come here saying,","“Mother,"]],[3314,["I have caught this, I have caught that.”"]],[3316,["So, in Sahaj Dharma, you being the Spirit,"]],[3319,["you also know about others, very well","and you can make it out,"]],[3325,["who is who, what chakras they are catching."]],[3329,["But the trouble in America, I found that","Sahaja Yogis used to,"]],[3335,["just could go and tell somebody, “You are","catching on this chakra.”"]],[3340,["Now, he has come for the first time and you","tell him,"]],[3343,["“You, you are very egoistical.” He says,","“How do you know?”"]],[3347,["“Your Agnya is catching.” Maybe, his own","Agnya might be catching."]],[3351,["Is this the way to receive a new person?"]],[3354,["Is this the way to talk to a new person?"]],[3358,["See, on the contrary, you should say,","“Come, sit down,"]],[3361,["very nice, you are very great, see?”"]],[3364,["Because they are still ignorant, so they","like some sort of"]],[3369,["buttering, as you call it, you see, we call","it chaplusi. Then, gradually,"]],[3374,["because you are doing this just to make","him a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3380,["because you love him. Basically that is","the reason."]],[3382,["But as soon as somebody comes in,","if you tell him,"]],[3385,["“This is wrong with you, that’s wrong","with you.”"]],[3389,["This is not a Pope’s business,"]],[3393,["where you go on telling people what’s","wrong with them,"]],[3396,["go and confess. To whom?"]],[3399,["To all these silly people. It’s not that."]],[3402,["What we have to show; that you have fallen","in love with that person,"]],[3407,["you are nice to that person because you","like that person."]],[3410,["Then gradually you pull him up."]],[3413,["But as soon as he comes you give him one","shot, so finished."]],[3417,["How can you have good relations?"]],[3420,["Americans have to learn this."]],[3422,["I don’t know why Americans think they are","very superior people."]],[3425,["I tell you for wisdom I would not say they","are so much."]],[3431,["It’s completely lacking – wisdom in them."]],[3434,["And they misunderstand people very fast,"]],[3438,["start judging others, is not the way you","can have Sahaj Dharma."]],[3443,["Sahaj Dharma is – you are your own. You","are in your own,"]],[3448,["you are in your own realm and in your","happiness and joy."]],[3451,["Where is the time to criticise others?"]],[3455,["So the best thing is to show your maximum","love to everyone."]],[3462,["In that love, you should not show your pity"]],[3465,["but love which is again: Alladha dayini."]],[3469,["This is the message of Shri Krishna but","I don’t know how many understood it."]],[3474,["Now, what you find those who are following","Shri Krishna, like Hare Rama people,"]],[3480,["they are really beggars on the street."]],[3483,["He is Kubera, and his disciples are all","beggars, can you imagine."]],[3488,["Does it add to His glory as Kubera?"]],[3492,["So, Sahaja Yogis are not like that."]],[3496,["Should be generous, should not bother too","much about yourself."]],[3503,["Should not all the time think about","yourself,"]],[3506,["but think of the collectivity, how you","behave."]],[3514,["Collectivity is not to bring – force people","to come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[3520,["Once they come to Sahaja Yoga they will","know the joy of life"]],[3524,["and you don’t have to tell them anything.","Nothing has to be told,"]],[3527,["just silently it will work and they will","feel your love."]],[3533,["You see, love is something so great."]],[3537,["It not only helps others but it also","helps you."]],[3543,["It’s so joyous to give realisation to","others."]],[3547,["But if you start telling, “Your this chakra","is catching”,"]],[3549,["why are you giving realisation?"]],[3551,["If you don’t know how to give realisation,","better not do it."]],[3555,["So, to criticise is not the way we can","enjoy love."]],[3562,["Ah, of course you can pull the legs of each","other sometimes,"]],[3566,["just for fun’s sake, but not to harm,"]],[3570,["not to torture, not to make that person","fall."]],[3577,["You are all Sahaj Dharmies, you have","accepted Sahaj Dharma"]],[3582,["and in Sahaj Dharma we have to have","pure love of the heart,"]],[3590,["not hypocrisy, and a sensible life."]],[3596,["Now, this Pope is against abortion.","I’m not."]],[3602,["If a woman is suffering, let her have","abortion."]],[3606,["The one who is living is more important","than the ones who are not living."]],[3611,["If somebody wants to have abortion, that","child can be born again."]],[3617,["According to us, nobody dies permanently,"]],[3623,["whatever it may be."]],[3625,["So, this is one way they use it for","propagation of human beings."]],[3634,["Like they say the Moslem women are","a like a factory."]],[3637,["They go on producing more children, more","children, more children."]],[3641,["So there are more voters."]],[3645,["So the Pope knows that. That’s why he","says, “Abortion, No.”"]],[3649,["Christians should not abort, because","then there will be"]],[3652,["less Christians to compete with","the Moslems."]],[3660,["But in Sahaja Yoga, we don’t have such","funny, radical, nonsensical things."]],[3665,["We have divorce, and we have also abortion,"]],[3671,["which is important to understand that these","are all taboos which are there."]],[3679,["But not for people who have to get out","of the troubles –"]],[3687,["you have to help them. Then that’s how","it works."]],[3692,["But to be very frank, we don’t have to do","abortions,"]],[3695,["it is achieved by Paramchaitanya."]],[3700,["Paramchaitanya does for me. I don’t have","to."]],[3704,["I don’t have to do anything. It’s","Paramchaitanya."]],[3708,["It’s nice because it knows what is to be","done, how to achieve it."]],[3714,["And sometimes you are in trouble, then know"]],[3717,["that you are not leaving things into the","hands of the Paramchaitanya."]],[3721,["If you leave it into the hands","of Paramchaitanya"]],[3723,["things will work out very well."]],[3727,["So, to understand Sahaja Yoga, first and","foremost thing is,"]],[3731,["how much you are enjoying yourself?"]],[3735,["How much enjoyment are you giving","to others?"]],[3740,["For that you have music, you have this,","that."]],[3743,["I was saying that today I won’t speak much,"]],[3746,["but, somehow, with Shri Krishna you can’t","keep quiet."]],[3753,["He played Murli, Bansuri, flute. Look","at Him."]],[3763,["I talked to you, but He just played Murli."]],[3768,["He didn’t talk so much, except for","the Gita, you won’t find Him talking."]],[3774,["And those who read also Gita are horrible","people, I tell you, I have met,"]],[3779,["those who read Gita. They don’t understand","what Shri Krishna’s Dharma is."]],[3783,["If they don’t understand Shri Krishna, how","will they understand Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3788,["So, for all of you is to practice on love,"]],[3797,["on forgiveness, on appreciating others,","on giving joy to others."]],[3806,["Some of the Sahaja Yogis have been very","kind to me also."]],[3811,["Once I went to the shop to buy a sari,","for myself"]],[3814,["and the sari was very expensive for my","purpose. So, I didn’t buy."]],[3822,["Said, “Let it be. This colour suits me,","alright, but it doesn’t matter.”"]],[3828,["I didn’t have so much money to buy that."]],[3832,["So, that Sahaja Yogi bought that sari"]],[3835,["and on my birthday gave me – and really,","I could not see"]],[3839,["because my eyes were filled with tears.","Just a small thing like that."]],[3846,["Normally I don’t expect you to do","anything for me, no."]],[3850,["But small, small things make you so happy."]],[3853,["But even if you do this to somebody, may","not understand,"]],[3856,["may not realize, may not feel it."]],[3859,["But if you are a Sahaja Yogi, you will."]],[3864,["So thank you very much; for all this that","I have said to you,"]],[3870,["try to enjoy yourself and make others","enjoy you."]],[3875,["May God bless you."]]]);
